  "findings": [
    "Rust migration inventory failed because the validator accepted only 16 MIG rows and treated C07.2-C07.9 decomposition rows as goal-specific rows; it also compared the inventory entry to the local, uncommitted C07 fixture revision instead of the fixture in this source SHA. Repairs were committed locally as 02049fc and 05c42a6; they are not in this tested SHA.",
    "Obsidian vault round-trip failed on Linux, macOS, and Windows during first-open ASC capture. Each platform selected Ascending.base and rendered group labels and row names, but the probe found no heading candidates or per-group DOM rows. The Windows failure artifact is 11852885275; exact platform job artifacts and metadata are listed above.",
    "Inventory repair and visible Bases group-row extraction changes remain unpushed pending a new exact-SHA CI repair attempt. No local executable validation was run."
  ]
}
